X_7._1.  _S_u_i_d _b_i_t_s
X
X     The current intended state of  affairs  is  that  _i_n_e_w_s
Xruns suid NEWSUSR.  The _r_e_a_d_n_e_w_s program does not need to be
Xsuid.  This makes it possible to write your own interface to
Xread news instead of using readnews.  (As distributed, _i_n_e_w_s
